": false, "text": "THE CONCLUSION THIS DRIVES", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "THE CONCLUSION THIS DRIVES", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e145", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 1816.5, "width": 2236.8, "height": 40.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g26"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1000704748, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1031640629, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Write volume is small enough that a single Postgres primary handles the entire booking workload - so don't sacrifice transactions for a scale problem you don't have. The two things that actually need engineering are the READ path (search, which leaves the OLTP database entirely) and the HOT PROMO\nROW during a sale, where a single row's lock becomes the throughput ceiling. Section 06 handles the second.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Write volume is small enough that a single Postgres primary handles the entire booking workload - so don't sacrifice transactions for a scale problem you don't have. The two things that actually need engineering are the READ path (search, which leaves the OLTP database entirely) and the HOT PROMO\nROW during a sale, where a single row's lock becomes the throughput ceiling. Section 06 handles the second.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e277", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 2030.5, "width": 2400, "height": 1611.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 32, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1315393613, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2090275229, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e147", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 2070.5, "width": 64, "height": 40, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g27"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 184435920, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 309489966, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e148", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 2077.5, "width": 29.8, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g27"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 219446234, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1609912491, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "03", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "03", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e149", "type": "text", "x": 144, "y": 2072.5, "width": 255.6, "height": 42.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g27"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 735804864, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1589892147, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Which database", "fontSize": 34, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Which database", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e150", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2132.5, "width": 1487.1, "height": 45.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 568561102, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1027832786, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "They asked this directly. The answer is PostgreSQL - and the reasoning matters more than the name. \"SQL because it's ACID\" and naming the specific invariants sound completely\ndifferent.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "They asked this directly. The answer is PostgreSQL - and the reasoning matters more than the name. \"SQL because it's ACID\" and naming the specific invariants sound completely\ndifferent.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e151", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2205.5, "width": 890.1, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#15803d", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1779953374, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1486180604, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "PostgreSQL as system of record - every hard requirement is a constraint spanning rows", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "PostgreSQL as system of record - every hard requirement is a constraint spanning rows", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e152", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 2243.5, "width": 1120, "height": 33.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g28"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 346686776, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1108819938, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e153", "type": "text", "x": 69, "y": 2251.5, "width": 85.4, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g28"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 49597690, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 440695868, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Requirement", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Requirement", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e154", "type": "text", "x": 489, "y": 2251.5, "width": 208.4, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g28"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2042225962, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2044449415, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Postgres feature that enforces it", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Postgres feature that enforces it", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e155", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 2277.0, "width": 1120, "height": 36.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g28"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1134424125, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 776857499, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e156", "type": "text", "x": 69, "y": 2286.0, "width": 154.6, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g28"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 314826550, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1481908851, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Never oversell a room", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Never oversell a room", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e157", "type": "text", "x": 489, "y": 2286.0, "width": 571.3, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g28"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1166453894, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1963113122, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CHECK (booked + held <= total) - the database refuses, even if my query is buggy", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "CHECK (booked + held <= total) - the database refuses, even if my query is buggy", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e158", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 2313.8, "width": 1120, "height": 36.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g28"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 58073303, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1628099606, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e159", "type": "text", "x": 69, "y": 2322.8, "width": 202.3, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g28"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1134106387, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 640142724, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Never exceed the promo cap", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Never exceed the promo cap", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e160", "type": "text", "x": 489, "y": 2322.8, "width": 477.3, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g28"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2101315414, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1380653906, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Guarded UPDATE ... WHERE used_count < max, atomic on one row", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Guarded UPDATE ... WHERE used_count < max, atomic on one row", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e161", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 2350.5, "width": 1120, "height": 36.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g28"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1853976394, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 195443666, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id