797, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0.0], [0, 217.2]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null}, {"id": "e270", "type": "line", "x": 1170, "y": 3232.2, "width": 0, "height": 217.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g42"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 594674889, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 90621425, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0.0], [0, 217.2]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null}, {"id": "e271", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 3485.5, "width": 1120, "height": 116.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a9eed", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g43"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1658418094, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 209906377, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e272", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 3499.5, "width": 218.5, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g43"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1090307498, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 971040407, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Sharding, when they push", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Sharding, when they push", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e273", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 3528.0, "width": 1079.1, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g43"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1206304673, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 59841250, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Shard by hotel_id when the time comes: a booking touches exactly one hotel, so every transaction stays inside one shard. Promo codes are\nlow-cardinality global config - replicate them everywhere or keep them in a small separate cluster; they don't shard by the same key, and that's fine\nbecause they're read-mostly with a hot-write burst you handle in section 06.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Shard by hotel_id when the time comes: a booking touches exactly one hotel, so every transaction stays inside one shard. Promo codes are\nlow-cardinality global config - replicate them everywhere or keep them in a small separate cluster; they don't shard by the same key, and that's fine\nbecause they're read-mostly with a hot-write burst you handle in section 06.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e274", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1220, "y": 3485.5, "width": 1120, "height": 111.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ef4444", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g44"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1632072836, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1919876317, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e275", "type": "text", "x": 1234, "y": 3499.5, "width": 184.6, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g44"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1959553144, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 136083547, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "THE READ-REPLICA TRAP", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "THE READ-REPLICA TRAP", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e276", "type": "text", "x": 1234, "y": 3523.0, "width": 1090.1, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g44"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 951868678, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 699249954, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Search reads from replicas, bookings write to the primary. So a user who just booked and lands on \"My Trips\" - served from a replica - sees nothing,\nand books again. Fix: read-your-writes. Pin the session to the primary for a few seconds after a write, or pass the write LSN and have the replica\nwait for it. Naming this before the interviewer does is worth a lot.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Search reads from replicas, bookings write to the primary. So a user who just booked and lands on \"My Trips\" - served from a replica - sees nothing,\nand books again. Fix: read-your-writes. Pin the session to the primary for a few seconds after a write, or pass the write LSN and have the replica\nwait for it. Naming this before the interviewer does is worth a lot.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e374", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 3762.0, "width": 2400, "height": 1742.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "#dbe4ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 32, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 382037089, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 580942356, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e278", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 3802.0, "width": 64, "height": 40, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g45"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1085667076, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1301670753, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e279", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 3809.0, "width": 29.8, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g45"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1099858400, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 428215122, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792010425260, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "04", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "04", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e280", "type": "text", "x": 144, "y": 3804.0, "width": 196.6, "height": 42.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g45"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1487628503, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 595251419, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 17920